THE NINTH HOUSE: third-party assets

Picture: drawn entirely in code (Canvas 2D stroke engine from the Lemo-Opuscar watercolor style). No stock footage, no generated video or images.
Paper texture: generated by paper.py (this project).
Fonts (SIL Open Font License 1.1, from Google Fonts): Cormorant Garamond, Caveat, Reenie Beanie, IBM Plex Mono.
Voice: Kokoro-82M TTS via kokoro-onnx (voice bm_george), Apache-2.0. Speech-to-text check: faster-whisper (MIT).
Music: original score by the film's agent, rendered from sampled instruments:
- Piano: "Salamander Grand Piano V3" by Alexander Holm, licensed under CC BY 3.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0/)
- Samples (CC0): FreePats project (freepats.zenvoid.org), VS Chamber Orchestra: Community Edition (Versilian Studios), Versilian Community Sample Library (Versilian Studios)
Sound effects: synthesised in mix.py (numpy/scipy).
Story, names and characters are fictional and original.
